{"meta":{"format_version":"5.0","model_format":"free","box_uv":false},"name":"torch_post","model_identifier":"torch_post","visible_box":[1,1,0],"variable_placeholders":"","multi_file_ruleset":"","variable_placeholder_buttons":[],"timeline_setups":[],"unhandled_root_fields":{"description":"# torch_post\n\nTorch post: a wooden post about 1.8 m (64 u) tall with an iron cup at the top.\n\nRemade in Patch 5 with a new look: a carved post with collars and notches on a cobble and stone footing, rope wraps, a player-colour ribbon, and an iron cup in a cage holding the flame.\n\n- Bounds (first set): x -4..4, y 0..75, z -4..4 units (0.25 x 2.11 x 0.25 m). Origin at the base centre, front faces -Z.\n- Texture: 128 x 128, 1 px per unit, square pixels, nearest filtering, flat pixel-art tones per material.\n- Cubes: 37, all in `finished`; no hidden state sets (the construction and ruined sets and the damaged/abandoned texture variants were removed in the Patch 5 remake; the game draws none of them for buildings).\n\n## Hit box\n\n- 8 x 64 x 8 post\n\n## Clips\n\n- `flicker` (0.8 s, loop): the flame flickers.\n\n## Attachment and effect points (empty groups)\n\n- `fx_flame` at (0, 68, 0)"},"resolution":{"width":128,"height":128},"elements":[{"name":"coal_pitch_cold#1a1614","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3.2,63.1,-3.2],"to":[3.2,64.1,3.2],"autouv":0,"color":0,"visibility":false,"origin":[0,0,0],"faces":{"north":{"uv":[54,68,60,69],"texture":0},"east":{"uv":[60,68,66,69],"texture":0},"south":{"uv":[66,68,72,69],"texture":0},"west":{"uv":[72,68,78,69],"texture":0},"up":{"uv":[112,0,118,6],"texture":0},"down":{"uv":[118,0,124,6],"texture":0}},"type":"cube","uuid":"8595248b-4e89-50da-a896-6dfb14ff0ff8"},{"name":"coal_pitch_lit#2a2420","box_uv":false,"render_order":"default","locked":false,"export":true,"scope":0,"allow_mirror_modeling":true,"from":[-3,63,-3],"to":[3,64.2,3],"autouv":0,"color":0,"orig